<title>USA: MGI PHARMA completes 1.2 mln shr offering.</title>
<headline>MGI PHARMA completes 1.2 mln shr offering.</headline>
<dateline>MINNETONKA, Minn. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>MGI PHARMA Inc said Monday it completed the sale of 1.2 million shares of its common stock in a public offering priced at $5 per share.</p>
<p>All of the shares were sold by the company.</p>
<p>Net proceeds of about $5.6 million will be used to finance the acquisition or licensing of additional products, the development and marketing of MGI PHARMA products, and for working capital, the company said.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
